A requirement diagram documents system requirements, the elements that implement or are tested by them, and the traceability relationships between them. Use it for systems engineering, safety-critical specifications, and V-model traceability. Uses `requirementDiagram`.

---

!! Basic example

```
requirementDiagram
    requirement sys_req {
        id: 1
        text: The system shall authenticate users.
        risk: high
        verifymethod: test
    }
    element login_module {
        type: component
    }
    login_module - satisfies -> sys_req
```

$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
